      // per page load, because a touchscreen laptop reports (pointer: coarse) while a mouse is in
      // use, which killed hover for the whole visit. Touch is left to the tap and finger-slide
      // handlers below, so a finger resting on a pill never switches the card on its own; the row's
      // pointerleave still releases the pause 2s after the pointer leaves the pills and cards.
      btn.addEventListener('pointerenter', function (event) {
